    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Sale by Private Treaty.\r\n\r\nDennehy Auctioneers are delighted to offer a rare opportunity to acquire a highly desirable two bedroom detached bungalow, ideally situated in a quiet, private cul de sac within a short stroll of Carrigaline town centre and its wide range of amenities. This superb property enjoys an exceptionally attractive and private south facing rear garden, providing an ideal outdoor space for relaxation and entertaining. A particularly noteworthy feature is the fully enclosed courtyard, a feature rarely found in more modern residential developments, offering an enhanced sense of privacy and security.\r\nInternally, the residence has been tastefully modernised and is presented in excellent condition throughout, benefiting from contemporary décor and a recently upgraded shower room suite. Combining a highly sought after location, single level accommodation, excellent privacy and a beautiful south facing garden, this charming bungalow represents a particularly attractive opportunity in the Carrigaline property market.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of Front Courtyard, Reception Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen/Dining Room, Two Bedroom and Shower Room. \r\n\r\nRecently installed composite front door to reception hall. Carpeted reception hall. Double doors to large airing cupboard with factory insulated copper cylinder. Hallway with Stira pull down ladder to attic storage. \r\n\r\nSitting Room: 3.84 m x 3 m \t\r\nAttractive contemporary oak door to sitting room. Carpeted. Open fireplace with cast iron and beech surround. Bow window.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 2.18 m x 3.83 m\r\nGood array of built in units. Fridge, washing machine and cooker can be included if required. Single drainer stainless steel sink.\r\n\r\nBedroom One: 3.19 m x 3 m\r\nCarpeted. Wardrobe, beds and bedside lockers can be included or removed at a purchaser’s discretion. Contemporary oak door to recently installed shower room with dual access from hallway.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two: 2.83 m x 2.42\r\nFree Standing wardrobe can be included at a purchaser’s discretion.\r\n\r\nShower Room:\r\nLarge shower room (wet room style), walls fully tiled throughout. Glass shower screen. Contemporary white suite of dual flush toilet, double sized inset wash hand basin with mono block chrome tap and vanity under. Chrome rack style radiator.\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nLarge fully walled in south facing rear garden. Flag stone patio with lawn and mature shrubberies. PVC oil tank. Free standing oil burner. Wooden garden shed. Side access to front courtyard. Front courtyard with double doors and pedestrian access door. Good sized front garden with concrete driveway, lawn and shrubberies.\r\n\r\nServices: \r\nMains water, mains sewer, oil fired central heating.\r\n\r\nTitle:\r\nFreehold"
      },
      {
